  ('1b4abf63-21e5-5f9c-8195-ae709dec24ee', 'math', 'data', 2, 'numeric', 'What is the mean of 2, 4, 6, and 8?', '{"correct":5}'),
  ('a0a45127-b94d-5cd2-8ede-181328cd07ed', 'math', 'percent', 2, 'numeric', 'What is 25 percent of 80?', '{"correct":20}'),
  ('529cbd55-f61f-53e1-acae-17b082343902', 'math', 'functions', 2, 'numeric', 'If y = 3x and x = 5, what is y?', '{"correct":15}'),
  ('5bbc4940-10a7-5b86-8f61-f9cc7869f1c8', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'Solar panels convert sunlight into electricity and reduce reliance on fossil fuels. Which choice best states the main idea of the sentence?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('5edeb580-e47a-59cd-a961-9ee49ba7a966', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'The library was quiet, and the students whispered. What can be inferred about the setting?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('40306812-dbf2-52d4-9d30-c516051ba91f', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The scientist was meticulous in recording each measurement. What is the closest meaning of meticulous?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('8be66fb3-0d8d-5417-8732-4791a5562214', 'reading', 'grammar', 1, 'mcq', 'Each of the players have a locker. Which change corrects the error?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('e21f0027-9b9f-5394-b30d-dd069bf64d89', 'reading', 'evidence', 2, 'mcq', 'The report states that exercise improves sleep, and the survey shows longer sleep among active adults. Which detail best supports the claim?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
