  ('4ed25df2-3485-47e1-9dec-c353e569dd98', 'math', 'data', 1, 'numeric', 'What is the mean of 10, 12, and 14?', '{"correct":12}'),
  ('52f1ba57-cf25-47b4-b8ed-115be2e7f5db', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'The storm cleared, and the sun appeared. What can be inferred?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('71473c33-8a4d-491b-8045-8d6579051bee', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The athlete was resilient after losing the race. What does resilient mean?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('1e435815-cd3d-41ef-bf49-8d36bd95d481', 'reading', 'grammar', 1, 'mcq', 'Each of the students have a notebook. Which change corrects the error?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('beb3340f-6078-4725-aea5-1a7aa04eab19', 'reading', 'purpose', 1, 'mcq', 'The passage lists steps to apply for a scholarship. What is the primary purpose?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('a7d7d62e-ac08-4c7b-80c6-a071d2c23c75', 'reading', 'tone', 1, 'mcq', 'The review praises the product as outstanding. What is the tone?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('1e267c3b-6bb8-4e20-9952-65ee7578269f', 'reading', 'evidence', 2, 'mcq', 'The article claims exercise improves memory, and a study reports higher recall among active adults. Which detail best supports the claim?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('30379678-1462-4184-ac82-b69556bd005e', 'reading', 'structure', 2, 'mcq', 'The paragraph compares two approaches and then chooses one. Which structure does this use?', '{"correct":"C"}'),
  ('d50e18e5-ed9d-4352-85f0-e1fbb2f4f6a7', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'She packed a coat and gloves before leaving. What can be inferred?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('128db728-ae80-429d-8de9-2245940a357d', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The solution was feasible given the budget. What does feasible mean?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('d3998df1-3092-4065-aa36-f7277f68cb8c', 'reading', 'grammar', 1, 'mcq', 'Neither of the answers are correct. Which change corrects the error?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('88ee1a2f-fef1-4bc5-9896-afce52089164', 'reading', 'tone', 1, 'mcq', 'The author laments the loss of the old park. What is the tone?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('8d0656d2-e5f3-4304-a4e4-473f24fd772d', 'reading', 'purpose', 1, 'mcq', 'The flyer invites residents to a neighborhood meeting. What is the primary purpose?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('79ae8fcc-3900-4eec-913f-d868509687ce', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'After weeks of training, his pace improved. What can be inferred?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('66f9458e-3a88-4f86-b11a-6b58c69e3b74', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The scientist was meticulous in labeling samples. What does meticulous mean?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('b4288460-e194-4854-8b9c-0eecb1833221', 'reading', 'structure', 2, 'mcq', 'The paragraph lists causes and then effects. Which structure does this use?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('9085b151-426a-4d1b-9fa8-967ae72f9698', 'reading', 'evidence', 2, 'mcq', 'The report states that cities with more trees have cooler temperatures. Which detail best supports the claim?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('d6b5e122-02b3-40ff-a95f-4b1823d71c65', 'reading', 'grammar', 2, 'mcq', 'The committee have reached its decision. Which change corrects the error?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('60453791-c2c7-4f35-855c-c94ffc19d84c', 'reading', 'tone', 1, 'mcq', 'The writer calls the plan risky and misguided. What is the tone?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
